    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A little man suffers from a rare cubic disease that takes away his eyesight while moving, now he is trying to return home, but a terrible disaster and an aggressive environment prevent him, will he be able to return back?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Color Madness</strong> is a side-view game where the player controls a cube that loses its eyesight when moving and moves from memory, dodging traps and overcoming various obstacles, jumping on platforms and avoiding collisions with dangerous cubes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Control:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WASD - moving</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visual style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High Difficulty</p></li></ul>",
